⍝ trith/lib/http.c: servers (plain and TLS) and their client in one program, split by fork.
The test runner makes the certificate and has the client trust it (SSL_CERT_FILE) ⍝
⎔ »krof« ⟨ ⊸ ℤ ⟩ ᚡᚠ ⸫
⸫ ᚡᚢ ⟨ ◌ℤ ⊸ ℤ ⟩ «netsil_ptth_htirt» ⎔
